{"title":"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(_!!FASTEST_SOLUTION!!_)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (&#160;!!FASTEST SOLUTION!! )</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_Horrendously!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK Horrendously!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On her first day of work, Janabel sold one widget. On day two, she sold three widgets. On day three, she sold five widgets, and on each succeeding day, she sold two more widgets than she had sold on the previous day. How many widgets in total had Janabel sold after working <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e97e5b9a40ceea5cdab1833721c7841808f360a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }39\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }40\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }210\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }400\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }401$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>First, we recognize that the number of widgets Janabel sells each day forms an arithmetic sequence. On day 1, she sells 1 widget, on day 2, she sells 3 widgets, on day 3, she sells 5 widgets, and so on. This sequence can be described by the first term \\( a = 1 \\) and the common difference \\( d = 2 \\).\n</p><p>Step 1: Find the number of widgets sold on day 20\n</p><p>The formula for the \\( n \\)-th term of an arithmetic sequence is:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/5/315b0b645fac36808d7040ad73f5ed155026d0b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_n = a + (n-1)d\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />\nFor \\( n = 20 \\):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/0/920d0f012b019ef36bc0c7ecbbdadd639e39e011.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{20} = 1 + (20-1) \\cdot 2 = 1 + 38 = 39\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So, Janabel sells 39 widgets on day 20.\n</p><p>Step 2: Calculate the total number of widgets sold in 20 days}\n</p><p>The sum \\( S_n \\) of the first \\( n \\) terms of an arithmetic sequence is given by:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/3/793a452d1a490ccbf49bb716013fa012c2f4ab5c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n = \\frac{n}{2} \\cdot (a + a_n)\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>For \\( n = 20 \\):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/7/7b74bfaae936449203c2685415bdb847062d738f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_{20} = \\frac{20}{2} \\cdot (1 + 39) = 10 \\cdot 40 = 400\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the total number of widgets sold after 20 days is:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d9eedef9e9d35b8d521bdaf158d8d5f878bd8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(40\\cdot10)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~400}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~ GeometryMystery\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>First, we have to find how many widgets she makes on Day <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We can write the linear equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b02f014ed66fb10f094dd795ead5f7fca29706cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-1+2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" /> to represent this situation. Then, we can plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704490b87dd48e3e59a430c4cad8e9eadcc05692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-1+2(20)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" /> -- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bda8eb8fa7576fc08f3c095d00999d5584dd05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-1+40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" /> -- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/8/068735b9cfe06809990db2a6733c6c4342a8f6cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />. The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db0c28b0ad3a03232c0a6e03d4ed77a179e8c73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,3,5, ... 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/096f2f41635a136466a07b2d3318f93e9f9fa30b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{(1 + 39)(20)}{2}= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~400}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28_.21.21FASTEST_SOLUTION.21.21_.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(_!!FASTEST_SOLUTION!!_)\">Solution 3 (&#160;!!FASTEST SOLUTION!! )</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (&#160;!!FASTEST SOLUTION!! )\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The sum is just the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> odd counting/natural numbers, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/178e99a5bf1fcc0d1fa54491b0f9531777aa105d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20^2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~400}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>Note: The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> odd numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>~ CHECKMATE2021\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can easily find out she makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc28f1a2fb87ae37e8ddd112615c664f2ef7735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot20-1 = 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" /> widgets on Day <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Then, we make the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/d/fcd42e95346e74ccb29563a9f87714e881b5a44e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,3, 5, ... ,35,37,39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"17\" /> by adding in this way: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d93720fe989f9bb31e3786a62c8f39aa5718470a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+39)+(3+37)+(5+35)+...+(19+21)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"370\" height=\"20\" />, which include <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> pairs of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. So, the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/1/8d14652901e02bf1a177a8e3cb8ac0480975cff8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,3,5, ...~39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d9eedef9e9d35b8d521bdaf158d8d5f878bd8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(40\\cdot10)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~400}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" />.\n--LarryFlora\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_Horrendously.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_Horrendously!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK Horrendously!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK Horrendously!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nw2v8sfT1i0\">https://youtu.be/nw2v8sfT1i0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1xHX4p3YnFs\">https://youtu.be/1xHX4p3YnFs</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8\">2015 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2015\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\